</div>
<div>
<div class="font-display-hero text-headline-sm tracking-tight text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
<span>NEXORA</span>
<span class="inline-block w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed"></span>
</div>
<p class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-primary-container tracking-wider uppercase">Enterprise IT Solutions</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="space-y-3 mt-4">
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 py-1 px-2.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-highest/10 text-on-tertiary-container font-label-caps text-label-caps">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed-dim animate-pulse"></span>
            SentinelOps Zero-Trust Portal
          </span>
<h1 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-white font-bold leading-snug">
            안전하고 편리한<br/>IT 서비스 환경
          </h1>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-outline-variant font-normal leading-relaxed pt-1">
            엔터프라이즈 인프라, 제로 트러스트 보안 및 SentinelOps 지능형 관제 포털에 오신 것을 환영합니다.
          </p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Trust Badges & Certifications -->
<div class="relative z-10 pt-8 mt-8 border-t border-outline-variant/10 space-y-4">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-highest/10 flex items-center justify-center text-secondary-fixed">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">verified_user</span>
</div>
<div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm font-semibold text-white">256-bit TLS/SSL 암호화 통신</p>
<p class="font-label-caps text-[11px] text-on-primary-container">전 구간 데이터 전송 암호화 보호 세션</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-highest/10 flex items-center justify-center text-secondary-fixed">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">lock</span>
</div>
<div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm font-semibold text-white">2단계 다중 인증(MFA) 지원</p>
<p class="font-label-caps text-[11px] text-on-primary-container">OTP 및 FIDO2 기반 기업 로그인 보안</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-highest/10 flex items-center justify-center text-secondary-fixed">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">policy</span>
</div>
<div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm font-semibold text-white">ISMS-P 인증 규격 준수</p>
<p class="font-label-caps text-[11px] text-on-primary-container">한국인터넷진흥원 정보보호 관리체계 적합</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="pt-2 flex items-center justify-between font-code-inline text-code-inline text-on-primary-container opacity-80">
<span>GATEWAY: KR-SEOUL-01</span>
<span class="flex items-center gap-1">
<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed"></span> 99.99% UP
          </span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Right Column: Login Form -->
<div class="w-full md:w-[55%] p-8 sm:p-10 lg:p-12 flex flex-col justify-between bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface">
<div>
<!-- Return Navigation Link -->
<div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-6">
<a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant hover:text-secondary transition-colors group" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/index.jsp">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-1">arrow_back</span>
<span>메인 홈으로 돌아가기</span>
</a>
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps py-0.5 px-2 rounded bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant">B2B PORTAL</span>
</div>
<!-- Form Header -->
<div class="mb-8">
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg font-bold text-on-surface tracking-tight">로그인</h2>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-1.5">등록된 기업 계정 정보를 입력해 주세요.</p>
</div>
<!-- Login Form Body (JSP Standard Form Format) -->
<form action="loginAction.do" class="space-y-5" id="loginForm" method="post">
<!-- User ID Input -->
<div class="space-y-1.5">
<label class="block font-body-sm text-body-sm font-semibold text-on-surface" for="userId">
              아이디 <span class="text-error font-normal">*</span>
</label>
<div class="relative flex items-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined absolute left-3.5 text-outline pointer-events-none text-[20px]">person</span>
<input autocomplete="username" class="w-full h-12 pl-11 pr-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface placeholder:text-outline focus:outline-none focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-secondary transition-all" id="userId" name="userId" placeholder="기업 계정 아이디 또는 이메일" required="" type="text"/>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Password Input -->
<div class="space-y-1.5">
<label class="block font-body-sm text-body-sm font-semibold text-on-surface" for="userPw">
              비밀번호 <span class="text-error font-normal">*</span>
</label>
<div class="relative flex items-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined absolute left-3.5 text-outline pointer-events-none text-[20px]">lock</span>
<input autocomplete="current-password" class="w-full h-12 pl-11 pr-11 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface placeholder:text-outline focus:outline-none focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-secondary transition-all" id="userPw" name="userPw" placeholder="비밀번호를 입력하세요" required="" type="password"/>
<button aria-label="비밀번호 표시 전환" class="absolute right-3.5 text-outline hover:text-on-surface p-0.5 flex items-center justify-center transition-colors" id="togglePwBtn" type="button">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]" id="togglePwIcon">visibility</span>
</button>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Options Row -->
<div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-1">
<label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer select-none">
<input checked="" class="w-4 h-4 rounded text-secondary bg-surface-container-low focus:ring-secondary cursor-pointer" id="rememberMe" name="rememberMe" type="checkbox"/>
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface font-medium">로그인 상태 유지</span>
</label>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">
<a class="hover:text-secondary transition-colors" href="#findId">아이디 찾기</a>
<span class="text-outline-variant select-none">·</span>
<a class="hover:text-secondary transition-colors" href="#findPw">비밀번호 찾기</a>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Submit Primary Button -->
<button class="w-full h-12 rounded-xl bg-secondary text-on-secondary font-headline-sm text-body-lg font-semibold hover:bg-secondary-container transition-all duration-150 shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2 active:scale-[0.99] mt-2" type="submit">
<span>로그인</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">login</span>
</button>
</form>
<!-- Divider and Secondary Registration -->
<div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-surface-container-high">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">아직 NEXORA 기업 회원이 아니신가요?</span>
</div>
<a class="w-full h-11 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-secondary font-headline-sm text-body-md font-semibold hover:bg-surface-container transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 group" href="#register">
<span>신규 기업 회원가입 신청</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">chevron_right</span>
</a>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Enterprise Compliance & Audit Footer -->
<div class="mt-8 pt-4">
<div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low/60 text-on-surface-variant">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-secondary mt-0.5">verified</span>
<p class="font-label-caps text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
            본 시스템은 인가된 기업 고객 및 임직원 전용입니다. 모든 접속 및 인증 시도는 이상 징후 감지 및 내부 보안 감사 로그에 안전하게 기록됩니다. (TLS 1.3 / ISO 27001)
          </p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<script>
  (function() {
    var toggleBtn = document.getElementById('togglePwBtn');
    var pwInput = document.getElementById('userPw');
    var icon = document.getElementById('togglePwIcon');

    if (toggleBtn && pwInput && icon) {
      toggleBtn.addEventListener('click', function() {
        if (pwInput.type === 'password') {
          pwInput.type = 'text';
          icon.textContent = 'visibility_off';
        } else {
          pwInput.type = 'password';
          icon.textContent = 'visibility';
        }
      });
    }
  })();
</script></main><jsp:include page="/inc/bottom.jsp" />
</body></html>